      en: ["Huang Yung-fu started painting the village in 2008 at the age of 84.", "The settlement was originally built for soldiers of the Kuomintang.", "His artistic protest saved 11 of the original houses from being demolished.", "The site was officially designated as a cultural park in Taichung in 2014.", "It is estimated that over 600,000 visitors visit Rainbow Village annually.", "The murals underwent significant restoration in 2022 following vandalism."],
      es: ["Huang Yung-fu comenzó a pintar en 2008.", "El pueblo consta de unas 50 casas.", "La superficie es de aproximadamente 0,5 hectáreas.", "En 2014 fue declarado patrimonio cultural.", "Más de 1 millón de visitantes al año.", "Huang Yung-fu nació en 1924."],
      pt: ["Huang Yung-fu começou a pintar em 2008.", "A aldeia consiste em cerca de 50 casas.", "A área é de cerca de 0,5 hectares.", "Em 2014, foi classificada como património cultural.", "Mais de 1 milhão de visitantes por ano.", "Huang Yung-fu nasceu em 1924."],
      fr: ["Huang Yung-fu a commencé à peindre en 2008.", "Le village se compose d'environ 50 maisons.", "La superficie est d'environ 0,5 hectare.", "En 2014, il a été classé au patrimoine culturel.", "Plus d'un million de visiteurs par an.", "Huang Yung-fu est né en 1924."],
